    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The common approach for training neural networks is using the stochastic gradient descent (SGD) algorithm (Bottou, 2012; LeCun, Bottou, Orr, &amp; Muller, 1998a) or a variant of it. SGD is a general optimization algorithm.</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
