    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An early stopping criterion is used, such that the geometric mean of the language model perplexity on the validation set is measured and as soon as one epoch results in a worse perplexity than the previous epoch, the training stops.</hasEvidenceText>
