    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">With large neural networks, however, the obvious idea of averaging the outputs of many separately trained nets is prohibitively expensive.</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
