    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">3.1.2 Loss Function For training RPNs, we assign a binary class label</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Backpropagation uses the chain rule to calculate the derivative of the loss function L with respect to each parameter in the network.</hasEvidenceText>
