    <skos:skos_definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A weight initialization method where weights are sampled from a zero-mean Gaussian distribution with a specific standard deviation, optimized for ReLU non-linearities.</skos:skos_definition>
